      "source": "https://www.wiscasset.gov/206/Historic-Prehistoric-Overview",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Wiscasset was abandoned during the French and Indian Wars and the King Philip’s War in 1675, then resettled around 1730.",
